{"sourceUrl":"https://dii.nju.edu.cn/c3/f5/c11317a836597/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:38.407070+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://dii.nju.edu.cn/c3/f5/c11317a836597/page.htm","html":"<div><p><span><span><span>     </span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>   为让全国高校优秀学子走进南京大学，全面了解以学科融合交叉为特色的南京大学匡亚明学院，促进优秀大学生之间的交流，南京大学匡亚明学院决定于</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>年暑期举办“交叉学科优秀大学生暑期开放日”（以下简称开放日）。现将有关事项通知如下：</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>一、参与对象</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）全国高校化学、物理、计算机、生物等基础学科及交叉学科相关专业的本科三年级在校生（拟于</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2027</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年毕业）。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）专业课学习成绩及英语水平优良，本科前</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>学期总评成绩在年级名列前茅。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）对学术研究兴趣浓厚，创新意识强、创新能力和专业素养突出，具有较强科研工作能力，有志于从事基础学科研究。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）身心健康、性格开朗。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>二、日程安排</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）时间：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>25—27</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日（若有变化将另行通知）</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）地点：南京大学仙林校区匡亚明学院</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）开放日期间将组织学院宣讲、与学院导师面对面交流、学生个人能力展示等活动。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）学院提供食堂就餐，交通及住宿自理。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>三、报名申请</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）请于</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>18</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>24:00</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>前完成报名流程。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）报名入口：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>https://table.nju.edu.cn/dtable/forms/241647b4-142a-4151-9363-3b56da7e50b5/</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>）学院导师简介如下：</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>https://dii.nju.edu.cn/lsjs/list.htm</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>；招生导师的代表性研究论文如下：</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>https://box.nju.edu.cn/d/e27480dbc29c4c04943d/</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>。请选择至少两篇论文，分别撰写不少于</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>2000</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>字</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>/</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>篇的阅</span></span><span><span><span>读笔记。内容包括但不限于：①论文的研究背景、研究方法和关键结论；②对论文相关内容开展后续研究的思考。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）请准确如实填写个人信息并上传附件，并在报到时请携带所有附件纸质材料。附件内容包括：①个人简历；②身份证正反面；③学生证封面和个人信息页；④本科阶段成绩单及排名证明；⑤英语水平证明材料（六级证书、托福、雅思、</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>GRE</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>等）；⑥荣誉获奖证明材料；⑦学术能力证明材料（论文、专利等）；⑧论文阅读笔记。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>四、</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>审核和确认</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>南京大学匡亚明学院将组织专家小组负责申请材料的审核工作，审核结束后我们会通过邮件通知入选同学，请报名的同学于</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>19</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日前登录报名填写的邮箱查看结果，并根据要求确认是否参加本次开放日，逾期未确认者视为自动放弃。</span></span></span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://dii.nju.edu.cn/c3/f5/c11317a836597/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\